b601_dm_description
===================

The robot model and meshes in this package are the reBot Arm B601-DM
description by Seeed Studio, taken from

  https://github.com/Seeed-Projects/reBotArmController_ROS2
  path:    src/rebotarm_bringup/description/DM
  commit:  87780c6a5c2fb43b55ddebda5eac375ceb9c5a40
  license: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE)

Modifications made for this repository:
  * urdf/ReBot_Arm_DM.urdf converted to the xacro macro urdf/b601_dm_macro.xacro
    (added a `parent` fixed joint, mesh URIs changed from
    package://rebotarm_bringup/description/DM/meshes/ to
    package://b601_dm_description/meshes/).
  * Inertial blocks added to finger_left_link and finger_right_link, which have
    none upstream (Gazebo drops non-fixed links without inertia).
  * meshes/mujoco_collision/ not included (MuJoCo only).
  * meshes/visual, meshes/collision and meshes/shared are unmodified.
